+From 3334a5e6c86f10e715cca3bf66ce0fc2f164b61b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Daniel Axtens <dja@axtens.net>
+Date: Wed, 13 Jan 2021 20:59:09 +1100
+Subject: [PATCH] io/gzio: Bail if gzio->tl/td is NULL
